# The build context of examples/start/Dockerfile is the top of the
# repository. These paths are build output, local tools and packages, which
# the image does not need and which a checkout that has run test.sh or
# built the site holds, and examples/, which compose.yaml mounts, so that a
# change of an example's script does not rebuild the image.
.git
.claude
build
build_dynamic
build_perf
mruby/build
site/node_modules
site/dist
site/generated
site/.astro
site/build-screenshots
examples
